Three-sentence answer for your lab

We use a service layer to separate business
 logic and database operations from HTTP routing. 
 This makes the code easier to test, reuse, and maintain because the same get_churn_summary() function can be called from different parts of the application. It also keeps the FastAPI route clean and focused only on handling the request and response.